        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Schreiber Foods, Forbes\n- Places: Port Plaza Mall\n- People: Robert Weissberg\n- Topics: publishing, private employers, redevelopment\n\nFacts:\n- Forbes is published bi-weekly and features original articles on finance, industry, investing, and marketing topics.\n- In 2012, the Port Plaza Mall property was razed in the first half of the year as part of a redevelopment project.\n- Schreiber Foods headquarters now stands on the main footprint of the former Port Plaza Mall.\n- In 2016, Forbes ranked Schreiber Foods as the 81st largest private employer, and Schreiber Foods had more than $5 billion in annual sales.\n- Robert Weissberg has written for magazines including Forbes, Society, and The Weekly Standard.",
